    "description" : "This DMP has been created fo managing data representative of the Open Publishing&#160; domain.&#160; Starting from our research questions&#160; related to&#160; scientometric studies , we aim at evaluating the management at the-state-of-the-art of data linked to articles (references) and to have an idea of &#8203;&#8203;how much the aggregators communicate with each other in terms of information sharing.<div><br></div><div>Our research involves the articles from Open Access journals in DOAJ and their data on Crossref. The produced datasets will be created combining the manipulation of both datasets retrieved from the above mentioned sources.&#160;</div>",
